      <h1 id="deploying-egress-router-ovn-redirection" class="group scroll-mt-20">Deploying an egress router pod in redirect mode<a href="#deploying-egress-router-ovn-redirection" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
