      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Optional parameter. Specifies the <code>namespace</code> for creating the egress router. If you do not specify a value in the file or on the command line, the <code>default</code> namespace is used.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.addresses</code></dt>
