      <CodeBlock code={"NAME                           READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE\negress-router-cni-deployment   1/1     1            1           18m"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>
      View the status of the egress router pod:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get pods -l app=egress-router-cni"} lang="terminal" />
      <CodeBlock code={"NAME                                            READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\negress-router-cni-deployment-575465c75c-qkq6m   1/1     Running   0          18m"} lang="terminal" title="Example output" />
      </li>
      <li>
      View the logs and the routing table for the egress router pod.
      <ol>
      <li>
      Get the node name for the egress router pod:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ POD_NODENAME=$(oc get pod -l app=egress-router-cni -o jsonpath=\"{.items[0].spec.nodeName}\")"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Enter into a debug session on the target node. This step instantiates a debug pod called <code>&lt;node_name&gt;-debug</code>:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc debug node/$POD_NODENAME"} lang="terminal" />
